### ⚓ Updated Folder Structure — HRMS App (Frontend Monorepo)

```
hrms-app/
├── apps/
│   └── frontend-ui-monorepo/
│       ├── public/
│       ├── src/
│       │   ├── assets/                     # images, icons, fonts
│       │   ├── components/                 # shared UI components (Navbar, Sidebar, etc.)
│       │   ├── features/                   # feature-wise modules
│       │   │   ├── auth/                   # 🔐 Authentication module (newly added)
│       │   │   │   ├── components/         # AuthLayout, AuthCard, OTPInput, etc.
│       │   │   │   ├── pages/              # Login, 2FA, Forgot Password, Verify Email, etc.
│       │   │   │   └── index.js            # central exports for all auth pages
│       │   │   ├── employee/               # Employee management module
│       │   │   ├── attendance/             # Attendance tracking
│       │   │   ├── leaves/                 # Leave management
│       │   │   ├── payroll/                # Payroll processing
│       │   │   ├── performance/            # Performance reviews
│       │   │   ├── settings/               # App configuration, role management
│       │   │   └── home/                   # Dashboard landing
│       │   ├── hooks/                      # custom React hooks
│       │   ├── layouts/                    # common layouts (DashboardLayout, AuthLayout)
│       │   ├── pages/                      # global route-level pages
│       │   ├── services/                   # API services using Axios/Fetch
│       │   ├── store/                      # state management (Redux/Zustand)
│       │   ├── utils/                      # helper functions (date, validation, etc.)
│       │   ├── constants/                  # static data (roles, endpoints)
│       │   ├── App.jsx                     # root routes and app entry
│       │   └── main.jsx                    # React DOM mount and Chakra setup
│       ├── package.json
│       └── vite.config.js
├── packages/
│   ├── ui/                                 # reusable UI components across apps
│   └── shared/                             # shared constants, utils, validations
├── package.json
└── turbo.json                              # Turborepo configuration
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 🧩 Auth Module Overview

**Location:**
`src/features/auth/`

**Purpose:**
Handles all authentication and access control flows.

**Contains:**

* **components/** → UI wrappers and reusable elements like `AuthLayout`, `OTPInput`
* **pages/** → Individual pages such as:

  * `LoginPage.jsx`
  * `TwoFactorPage.jsx`
  * `ForgotPasswordPage.jsx`
  * `VerifyEmailPage.jsx`
  * `ResetPasswordPage.jsx`
  * `PasswordChangedPage.jsx`
* **index.js** → Central export file for easy imports in routing.

