## ✅ Completed - Auth0 Integration (November 20, 2025)

### Frontend Setup & Auth0 Integration
- Designed and completed UI for 6 authentication pages (Login, 2FA, Forgot Password, Verify Email, Reset Password, Password Changed)
- Integrated Auth0 authentication service with React
- Configured Auth0 Single Page Application (SPA) with domain and client ID
- Set up environment variables for secure credential management
- Wrapped application with Auth0Provider in main.jsx
- Updated LoginPage to use Auth0 Universal Login via `loginWithRedirect()`
- Created reusable `LogoutButton` component in atomic design structure
- Built `ProtectedRoute` wrapper component for route security
- Configured routing system with proper redirects:
  - Root `/` → redirects to `/login` (unauthenticated) or `/home` (authenticated)
  - `/home` → protected route requiring authentication
  - Logout → redirects back to `/login`
- Successfully tested complete authentication flow

### Tech Stack
- React + Vite
- Auth0 React SDK (@auth0/auth0-react)
- Chakra UI
- React Router v6
